{"v":[{"a":["قُلۡ","هُوَ","ٱللَّهُ","أَحَدٌ"],"t":"Say, “He is God, the One","l":"Qul Huwa Allahu 'Ahadun","w":[["qul","Say"],["huwa","He"],["l-lahu","(is) Allah"],["aḥadun","the One"]]},{"a":["ٱللَّهُ","ٱلصَّمَدُ"],"t":"God, the Absolute","l":"Allahu As-Samadu","w":[["al-lahu","Allah"],["l-ṣamadu","the Eternal, the Absolute"]]},{"a":["لَمۡ","يَلِدۡ","وَلَمۡ","يُولَدۡ"],"t":"He begets not, nor was He begotten","l":"Lam Yalid Wa Lam Yulad","w":[["lam","Not"],["yalid","He begets"],["walam","and not"],["yūlad","He is begotten"]]},{"a":["وَلَمۡ","يَكُن","لَّهُۥ","كُفُوًا","أَحَدُۢ"],"t":"And there is nothing comparable to Him.”","l":"Walam Yakun Lahu Kufuan 'Ahadun","w":[["walam","And not"],["yakun","is"],["lahu","for Him"],["kufuwan","equivalent"],["aḥadun","any [one]"]]}]}